{{page>meta:infobox:construction&noheader&nofooter&noeditbtn}}

[[https://www.pine64.org/devices/single-board-computers/pine-a64/|Pine64 PINE A64(+)]] is a development board / [[wp>single-board computer]] based on the [[wp>Allwinner Technology|Allwinner]] A64 SoC. Base configuration comes with quad core ARMv8 (64-bit ARM), single ethernet port, expansion port for optional Bluetooth 4.0/802.11 b/g/n expansion board, Raspberry Pi compatible 40-pin GPIO header, 34 pin Euler Bus and 10 pin  Expansion Bus. PINE A64 has 512Mb Ram and 10/100 ethernet while PINE A64+ provides 1024/2048Mb Ram and gigabit ethernet.

OpenWrt build target [[docs:techref:targets:sunxi|sunxi]] cortexa53 contains a Target profile for the board.

{{media:pine64:pine64_a64plus_top.jpg|Pine64 PINE A64+}}

