===== Notes =====

**Upper USB Port is not working.**\\ The port is wired to a USB-OTG controller ([[https://linux-sunxi.org/Pine64#USB_controllers_and_ports|more info]]) which kernel drivers are not built in current OpenWrt images.


  * Kernel config lines for host mode on OTG conroller:\\ <code>CONFIG_USB_MUSB_HDRC=y
CONFIG_USB_MUSB_HOST=y
CONFIG_USB_MUSB_SUNXI=y
CONFIG_MUSB_PIO_ONLY=y  # no driver support for DMA mode!
CONFIG_NOP_USB_XCEIV=y</code>

